{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, move to it, take it, check its properties, do specific task or explore area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    />",
